WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.464 --> 00:00:18.811
The was in the kitchen, planning to shop for school supplies.

2
00:00:19.951 --> 00:00:23.153
Vinnie and Mandy were about to start at a new school.

3
00:00:24.333 --> 00:00:26.194
But they weren't very excited.

4
00:00:26.214 --> 00:00:29.535
"Come on, you'll make new friends!"

5
00:00:30.016 --> 00:00:30.676
said Dad.

6
00:00:31.828 --> 00:00:34.369
"Yeah, I know," Vinnie sighed.

7
00:00:34.389 --> 00:00:40.191
"But they won't be the same friends," said Mandy unhappily.

8
00:00:41.532 --> 00:00:45.954
The children were sad because their photo trips were almost over.

9
00:00:47.074 --> 00:00:49.495
Only one page was left in the album.

10
00:00:50.736 --> 00:00:52.456
Just then the phone rang.

11
00:00:53.617 --> 00:00:54.737
It was Dad's boss.

12
00:00:54.757 --> 00:00:59.119
"Sorry, but I need some privacy," said Dad.

13
00:00:59.139 --> 00:01:02.757
"No problem, Dad," said Vinnie.

14
00:01:02.777 --> 00:01:07.460
"We'll talk later about school, kids," said Mom.

15
00:01:09.001 --> 00:01:11.243
Vinnie and Mandy ran up to the attic.

16
00:01:11.263 --> 00:01:13.625
"Can you believe it?

17
00:01:14.726 --> 00:01:17.528
Our last photo trip," said Mandy.

18
00:01:18.789 --> 00:01:20.069
She hugged the album.

19
00:01:20.089 --> 00:01:23.312
"Well, let's do it!"

20
00:01:23.852 --> 00:01:24.593
cried Vinnie.

21
00:01:25.814 --> 00:01:28.596
Mandy opened the album to the last page.

22
00:01:29.756 --> 00:01:33.978
The old man stood in a beautiful cathedral with tall columns.

23
00:01:35.199 --> 00:01:38.201
The old man held a glowing object in his hands.

24
00:01:38.221 --> 00:01:40.442
"A book?"

25
00:01:41.183 --> 00:01:44.004
asked Mandy, looking at the glowing object.

26
00:01:45.125 --> 00:01:46.485
"What do you think, Vinnie?"

27
00:01:46.505 --> 00:01:49.667
"No use guessing," he said.

28
00:01:49.687 --> 00:01:52.129
"We'll find out soon!"

29
00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:57.852
The children's eyes closed, and they fell down the dark tunnel.

30
00:01:59.772 --> 00:02:03.833
Vinnie and Mandy landed on a stone floor and opened their eyes.

31
00:02:05.734 --> 00:02:08.875
Mandy was wearing a long dress with long sleeves.

32
00:02:10.155 --> 00:02:12.636
Vinnie wore stockings and a short tunic.

33
00:02:12.656 --> 00:02:17.577
"We're in some kind of storage room," said Vinnie.

34
00:02:18.758 --> 00:02:22.999
Stacks of paper, brushes, and rags were piled around them.

35
00:02:24.359 --> 00:02:27.060
Hammers and other tools were scattered about.

36
00:02:28.420 --> 00:02:31.923
Large, flat panels of wood leaned against the wall.

37
00:02:31.943 --> 00:02:39.528
"It must be a painter's storage room," said Mandy, picking up a paint brush.

38
00:02:40.769 --> 00:02:45.032
The door opened, and a boy a little older than Vinnie walked in.

39
00:02:46.133 --> 00:02:48.014
He was thin with curly hair.

40
00:02:49.095 --> 00:02:50.916
He stared at Vinnie and Mandy.

41
00:02:50.936 --> 00:02:55.700
"Oh, hello," Mandy said nervously.

42
00:02:56.844 --> 00:02:58.525
"What are you guys doing here?"

43
00:02:59.066 --> 00:02:59.886
the boy asked.

44
00:02:59.906 --> 00:03:04.189
"We were just stammered Vinnie.

45
00:03:04.209 --> 00:03:08.012
"You are not from here," the boy said.

46
00:03:08.032 --> 00:03:09.853
"How did you know?"

47
00:03:10.593 --> 00:03:11.334
asked Mandy.

48
00:03:11.354 --> 00:03:18.199
"No one would come into Master Verrocchio's workshop uninvited," the boy said.

49
00:03:19.399 --> 00:03:21.201
The children looked embarrassed.

50
00:03:22.481 --> 00:03:26.024
"We don't know our way around," Vinnie said.

51
00:03:27.516 --> 00:03:29.037
The boy smiled warmly.

52
00:03:29.057 --> 00:03:32.138
"I can show you the city," he said.

53
00:03:32.158 --> 00:03:35.179
"But I must see the master first."

54
00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:39.481
The boy picked up a stack of rags and some brushes.

55
00:03:39.501 --> 00:03:42.943
"Have you worked for your master long?"

56
00:03:43.683 --> 00:03:46.424
asked Vinnie, thinking the boy was a servant.

57
00:03:46.444 --> 00:03:48.925
"He is not my master.

58
00:03:50.146 --> 00:03:52.026
He is the master of this workshop.

59
00:03:53.267 --> 00:03:55.328
I am his student," said the boy.

60
00:03:56.976 --> 00:03:58.898
"Student?" asked Vinnie.

61
00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:06.948
The boy looked at him and replied, "I am studying to become the greatest artist in the world."
